        <PartOf>games.emulator</PartOf>
        <Summary xml:lang="en">ScummVM is a program which allows you to run certain classic graphical point-and-click adventure games</Summary>
        <Description xml:lang="en">ScummVM is a program which allows you to run certain classic graphical point-and-click adventure games, provided you already have their data files. The clever part about this: ScummVM just replaces the executables shipped with the games, allowing you to play them on systems for which they were never designed!
</Description>
